## Progress (2026-10-30)

Implementation `30144e03`, checked after merging current main in `007f0a42`: **102 NRL tests, 18 unchanged nnpkg tests, six portable release builds**, all standard CLI cycles, 70 fresh differential exports and three CLI package profiles pass. [Evidence](../nrl/reports/portable-import-2026-10-30.json), [differential case identities/layout/charges](../nrl/reports/portable-import-cases-2026-10-30.json), [CLI reports](../nrl/reports/portable-import-cli-2026-10-30.json). APP/KRN implementation was not edited. Source was built and merged/pushed into fast-test before the affected-check run; no fast-test build/test was used. Handoff was subsequently delivered to APP/KRN; see Resolution. Native 0017 criteria remain open.

## Resolution

Added the bounded offline `check-native-model MODEL INPUT_JSON NEW_REPORT` host command, linked to APP's actual no_std nnpkg implementation. It checks direct/parser-answer/job-description paths, writer bytes and model identity, graph layout, numerical output, resource charges/checkpoints, one-shot output retrieval and portable service-accounting cleanup. The integration suite constructs 70 fresh valid exports across dimensions, optional biases, all five representations and conversions, valid subgraphs/ties, Unicode/control provenance, classification labels, materialized history and the parameter/object/node bounds. Refusals retain the declared model/writer/IPC limits and immutable output.

Checked on `007f0a4290349aade1972b948aee47223df4f185`: **102 NRL tests + 18 unchanged nnpkg tests, six portable release builds, all standard CLI cycles**, including fresh/materialized/actually trained regression exports. The evidence and raw logs are linked above. Implementation `30144e03`, published handoff/evidence `0e9cbf216813482abc8299cb3f96ea545b3b7328`. No APP/KRN implementation or OS profile guarantee was changed.

Delivered results on internal-dev-messages: [APP/2026-10-30T1156Z-NRL-portable-importer-checked-on-70-live-exports.md](https://github.com/NikolayUvarov/gcu_undocumented_func/blob/internal-dev-messages/APP/2026-10-30T1156Z-NRL-portable-importer-checked-on-70-live-exports.md) (`c1f27331`); [KRN/2026-10-30T1156Z-NRL-nnd-boot-recognized-portable-handoff-verified.md](https://github.com/NikolayUvarov/gcu_undocumented_func/blob/internal-dev-messages/KRN/2026-10-30T1156Z-NRL-nnd-boot-recognized-portable-handoff-verified.md) (`09f9a97f`). APP's remaining native work stays in [262-APP-0112](../issues/262-APP-0112-nnd-and-nn-wit-stage-0.md): the client/badge lifetime, two granted file scopes and named-target nncheck/model suite. KRN's boot/grant work is already landed; no 0179 dependency was introduced. [900-NRL-0017](../issues/900-NRL-0017-native-runtime-and-nnd-integration.md) remains open. Host execution of portable code is not native IPC/worker isolation or measured native memory release. Landing and the full repository gate remain with the integrator.
